  unitName: Firedrake
  unitId: 10092
  unitNumber: 111
  description: A fire dragon that lives in the Agni volcanoes. It is the only fire
    dragon that can fly. A Firedrake breathes fire and scorches the land with hellfire
    by flapping its wings. Although it understands human speech, its high intelligence
    makes it look down on humans, making it difficult to ally with. It only cooperates
    with those who pique its strong curiosity.
  summonDesc: You wish to ally with me?<br>Well then, let's test your<br>might!
  fusionDesc: Give me more fire.<br>This is not enough.
